                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B> </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">“我家孩子在学校表现怎么样？”“食堂吃得好吗？”“寝室睡得香吗？”半个学期过去了，孩子的高中生活到底过得怎么样，学校请您来看一看。为了让家长们更好的了解孩子在学校的学习和生活情况，加强家校之间的沟通与交流，达到家校共育的目的，我校于<FONT face=Calibri>10</FONT><FONT face=宋体>月</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>29</FONT><FONT face=宋体>日上午举行了</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>2020</FONT><FONT face=宋体>学年“家长开放日”活动，</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>200</FONT><FONT face=宋体>多名学生家长参加了此次活动。本次开放日活动主要安排了家长参观学校、家校研讨、进班听课、晚学考察，并邀请家长对学校工作提出宝贵的意见和建议等。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>家校研讨携手育人</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>上午</FONT>7:35<FONT face=宋体>分左右，应邀家长陆续到场，在年级长、老师的接待下签到、领取资料，随后在图书馆报告厅（二）听取报告会。王琛校长从“近一年的学校情况”“如何看待现在的孩子”和“学校</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>2020</FONT><FONT face=宋体>学年后续的工作”三个方面同家长进行了深入交流，指出家校合力为孩子创设良好教育环境对孩子和学校都非常重要。希望家长们多多走进校园，与学校携手，共创孩子美好的未来。与会家长也表示，希望借助家校合作的平台充分了解孩子在校的学习生活，了解学校在教育教学上的独特管理方案，为学校的教育教学工作和校园文化建设工作提供有力支持，共同促进孩子的全面发展。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></SPAN>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021233053.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021233045.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021233070.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021233010.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021233090.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021233073.jpg"><BR></o:p></SPAN></P><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>重返校园追忆青春</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>会后，家长们在第二节、第三节课的时间里分别走进课堂，和自己的孩子一同听课，一睹老师的课堂风采，零距离感受精彩的课堂氛围。开放日的课堂上，老师们积极引导学生进行自主探究，开展合作学习，使学生在轻松愉快的氛围中掌握所学内容。家长们关注着自己孩子在课堂上的学习状态，为自己孩子在课堂上的精彩表现而露出会心的微笑。课堂上的家长除了是</FONT>“观察员”，还是“摄影师”，举着手机拍下了一个个难忘的瞬间。“原来我的孩子在课堂上挺积极的，一直举手回答问题，上课很认真！”“这高中课堂真的是很有趣呀！真想重新回到高中生活！”</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021251546.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021251510.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021251587.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021251528.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021251509.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021251591.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021251518.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021251538.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021251551.jpg"><BR></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>还未回味完课堂的精彩，家长们就被悦耳的大课间铃声吸引到了操场。明媚的阳光下，孩子们在操场上进行每日跑操活动，整齐划一的步伐，铿锵有力的口号，锁定了每一位在场家长的目光。跑操期间，学生展示出的蓬勃朝气，青春活力，让家长频频点赞，这才是青春该有的模样！</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021263564.png"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021263504.jpg"><BR><BR></P></o:p></SPAN>
<P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>温情陪伴共见成长</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>课后，家长们与班主任、任课老师进行了交流，双方都对学生的学习和生活有了更加充分的了解，达成了更多的教育共识。</FONT>“非常感谢老师们的辛勤付出，老师们娴熟的教学技能以及对孩子无微不至的关爱让我们放心、安心。有这么优秀的教师团队作为学生们的引路人，这是孩子们的幸运，也是我们的幸运。”交流结束后，家长在各班主任组织下于食堂就餐，亲身体验学校食堂的膳食，体会到了一中食堂的特色。随后，家长们前往学生宿舍参观，对学校的住宿条件和文宿舍文化大加赞赏。晚自修期间，部分受邀家长考察了当天学生的晚自修学习情况，他们纷纷对学校晚自修的管理和答疑老师认真负责的态度表示肯定。</SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021274178.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021274170.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021274195.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021274135.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021274116.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021274198.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021274125.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) style="BORDER-TOP-COLOR: ; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: ; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: ; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: " onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202010/2020103021274145.jpg"><BR></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>走进高中生的一天，家长们收获满满。家长们走入校园，走进课堂，与孩子共同学习，重温校园时光。美丽的教学楼，整洁的教室，宽阔的操场，可爱的学生，可亲的老师，这一切都让家长在不知不觉中，加深了对绍兴一中的喜爱。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">“家长开放日”是一个重要的家校合作平台，是学校与家长之间进行沟通交流的一座桥梁。此次开放日活动拉近了家校之间的距离，使家长对孩子在学校的学习和生活有了更进一步的了解。同时，家长通过对学校教育和管理工作的反馈，也为学校的发展建设贡献了力量，向着“家校同心，共育共享”的目标更近了一步。感谢家长们选择一中，相信一中，一中将继续秉承爱与责任的信念砥砺前行！</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
